From: Sherif Shalaby <sherif2222222@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 17:40:44 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] libstagefright: restore CameraSource data-callback video
 modes

Android 13 CameraSource/CameraSourceTimeLapse (BUFFER_QUEUE, then
DATA_CALLBACK_METADATA, then DATA_CALLBACK_YUV) adapted to the 14
Camera::connect signature. HALv1 cameras record through metadata mode.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
